    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128477795\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Types of, in Anticipation</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul class=\"reference\">\n<li>\n<p class=\"title\" data-aid=\"128477796\" id=\"title2\"><em>See also</em> <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/passover?lang=eng\">Passover</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/sacrifice?lang=eng\">Sacrifice</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/tg/symbolism?lang=eng\">Symbolism</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477797\" id=\"p1\">Abel … brought of the <span class=\"key-word\">firstlings</span> of his flock, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/gen/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Gen. 4:4</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p20#p20\">Moses 5:20</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477798\" id=\"p2\">God will provide himself a <span class=\"key-word\">lamb</span> for a burnt offering, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/gen/22?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">Gen. 22:8</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477799\" id=\"p3\"><span class=\"key-word\">lamb</span> shall be without blemish, a male, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ex/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Ex. 12:5</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-pet/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">1 Pet. 1:19</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477800\" id=\"p4\">take you a lamb … and kill the <span class=\"key-word\">passover</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ex/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p21#p21\">Ex. 12:21</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Rev. 5:6</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477801\" id=\"p5\"><span class=\"key-word\">manna</span> … the bread which the Lord hath given, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ex/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Ex. 16:15</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ex/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">16:4</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p51#p51\">John 6:51</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477802\" id=\"p6\">smite the rock … come <span class=\"key-word\">water</span> out of it, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ex/17?lang=eng&amp;id=p6#p6\">Ex. 17:6</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">1 Cor. 10:4</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477803\" id=\"p7\">Behold the <span class=\"key-word\">blood</span> of the covenant, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ex/24?lang=eng&amp;id=p8#p8\">Ex. 24:8</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477804\" id=\"p8\">goat shall bear upon him all their <span class=\"key-word\">iniquities</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/lev/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p22#p22\">Lev. 16:22</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477805\" id=\"p9\">nor <span class=\"key-word\">break</span> any bone of it, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/num/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">Num. 9:12</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p33#p33\">John 19:33</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477806\" id=\"p10\">Moses made a <span class=\"key-word\">serpent</span> of brass, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/num/21?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Num. 21:9</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">John 3:14</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/33?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">Alma 33:19</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/hel/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Hel. 8:14</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477807\" id=\"p11\">fed thee with <span class=\"key-word\">manna</span>, which thou knewest not, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/deut/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">Deut. 8:3</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/rev/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Rev. 2:17</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477808\" id=\"p12\"><span class=\"key-word\">priest</span> for ever after the order of Melchizedek, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/ps/110?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">Ps. 110:4</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Heb. 5:10</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477809\" id=\"p13\">in the <span class=\"key-word\">belly</span> of the fish three days and three nights, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/ot/jonah/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Jonah 1:17</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p40#p40\">Matt. 12:40</a>).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477810\" id=\"p14\"><span class=\"key-word\">Lamb</span> of God, which taketh away the sin, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p29#p29\">John 1:29</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477811\" id=\"p15\">Christ our <span class=\"key-word\">passover</span> is sacrificed for us, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">1 Cor. 5:7</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477812\" id=\"p16\"><span class=\"key-word\">Rock</span> was Christ, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/1-cor/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">1 Cor. 10:4</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477813\" id=\"p17\">which <span class=\"key-word\">veil</span> is done away in Christ, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/2-cor/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">2 Cor. 3:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477814\" id=\"p18\">a <span class=\"key-word\">shadow</span> of things to come, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/col/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p17#p17\">Col. 2:17</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477815\" id=\"p19\">Who serve unto the example and <span class=\"key-word\">shadow</span> of heavenly things, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Heb. 8:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477816\" id=\"p20\">a <span class=\"key-word\">figure</span> for the time then present, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/9?lang=eng&amp;id=p9#p9\">Heb. 9:9</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477817\" id=\"p21\">sanctified through the <span class=\"key-word\">offering</span> … of Jesus Christ, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p10#p10\">Heb. 10:10</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477818\" id=\"p22\">offereth himself a <span class=\"key-word\">sacrifice</span> for sin, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">2 Ne. 2:7</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478819\" id=\"p23\">this end hath the law of Moses … the <span class=\"key-word\">typifying</span> of him, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/2-ne/11?lang=eng&amp;id=p4#p4\">2 Ne. 11:4</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/gal/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p24#p24\">Gal. 3:24</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/heb/10?lang=eng&amp;id=p1#p1\">Heb. 10:1</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/16?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Mosiah 16:14</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/25?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Alma 25:15</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/34?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">34:14</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478820\" id=\"p24\">Abraham … offering up his son Isaac, which is a <span class=\"key-word\">similitude</span> of God, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/jacob/4?lang=eng&amp;id=p5#p5\">Jacob 4:5</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478821\" id=\"p25\"><span class=\"key-word\">types</span>, and shadows showed he unto them, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p15#p15\">Mosiah 3:15</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478823\" id=\"p26\">all these things were <span class=\"key-word\">types</span> of things to come, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/mosiah/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p31#p31\">Mosiah 13:31</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478824\" id=\"p27\">it being a <span class=\"key-word\">type</span> of his order, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p16#p16\">Alma 13:16</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478825\" id=\"p28\">is there not a <span class=\"key-word\">type</span> in this thing, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/bofm/alma/37?lang=eng&amp;id=p45#p45\">Alma 37:45</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478826\" id=\"p29\">a <span class=\"key-word\">similitude</span> of the sacrifice of the Only Begotten, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/5?lang=eng&amp;id=p7#p7\">Moses 5:7</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/dc-testament/dc/138?lang=eng&amp;id=p13#p13\">D&amp;C 138:13</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128478827\" id=\"p30\">all things have their <span class=\"key-word\">likeness</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/pgp/moses/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p63#p63\">Moses 6:63</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
